{"version":1,"content":"<p>戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》話題不斷，當中人氣女星俞可程（Kanis）更加係網民討論嘅焦點。</p><p>不過，正當節目播得如火如荼之際，Kanis今日深夜突然喺個人社交平台限時動態投下震撼彈，正式宣布主動退出《女神配對計劃2》嘅拍攝！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:43:50.796470+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:25:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T05:37:12.907311+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T05:37:12.907311+00:00","content_hash":"cad651e958ff6c8fc442276cd10d663d30ad08403047a6d1eb4b277f8666f720","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}